<table class="MsoNormalTable" border="1" cellpadding="0" style="width: 584px; background: white; border: 1pt solid #e5e5e5;" height="492">
<tbody>
<tr style="height: 60px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 9pt 0.75pt 3.75pt 35.25pt; height: 60px; width: 667.323px;">
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 24pt; font-family: Tahoma, 'sans-serif'; color: #086db6;"><span>Welcome: </span>verify your email address</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 10px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 30pt 0.75pt 27.75pt; height: 10px; width: 638.323px;"></td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 351px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 0.75pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 351px; width: 670.323px;" id="emailMainDiv">
<table style="width: 670.333px;">
<tbody>
<tr style="height: 41px;">
<td style="height: 41px; width: 666.333px;">
<p><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 12pt; color: #666666;"><strong>Action Required</strong></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 93px;">
<td style="height: 93px; width: 666.333px;">
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #666666;">This notice is to inform you that a profile has been created for you by an Intel</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><span style="color: #666666;">Account Representative so you may participate in the</span> <span style="color: #086db6;"><a href="https://partnercenter.intel.com" style="color: #086db6;">Intel Co-Marketing Portal</a></span> <span style="color: #666666;">for your company,</span></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #666666;">With the log in information below you can access the web portal at:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #086db6;"><a href="https://partnercenter.intel.com" style="color: #086db6;">https://partnercenter.intel.com</a>.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #666666;">Please retain this e-mail for future reference.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 41px;">
<td style="height: 41px; width: 666.333px;">
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #666666;"><strong>Email ID:</strong> {!Contact.Email}</span><br><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #666666;"><strong>Intel Business Account Name:</strong> <span>{!Account.Name}</span></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 41px;">
<td style="height: 41px; width: 666.333px;">
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #666666;"><strong>What you need to do:</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><span style="color: #666666;">Complete your set up by clicking this</span> <span style="color: #086db6;"><a href="https://partnercenter.intel.com/login?so=00Do0000000aRcf" style="color: #086db6;">link</a> </span><span style="color: #666666;">or by copying the URL into your browser.</span></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><span style="color: #666666;">If you feel you’ve received this e-mail in error, please contact</span> <span style="color: #086db6;"><a href="https://intelinside.intel.com/support" style="color: #086db6;">Intel Customer Support</a>.</span></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #666666;">Thank you for your interest! Please follow this link to complete your set up.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><span style="color: #666666;">Visit</span> <span style="color: #086db6;"><a href="https://www-ssl.intel.com/content/www/us/en/my-intel/manage-profile.html" style="color: #086db6;">My Intel</a></span> <span style="color: #666666;">any time to manage your profile.</span></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 96px;">
<td style="height: 96px; width: 666.333px;">
<p><span style="font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-family: calibri;"><span style="color: #666666;">Please DO NOT reply to this e-mail message. This is an automated response.</span></span><span style="font-family: calibri;"> </span></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-family: calibri; color: #666666;">To ensure that you continue receiving our e-mails, please add us to your address book. </span><span style="font-family: calibri;"><span style="color: #666666;">                                                              </span></span></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; text-align: right;"><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"> <img class="floating" src="https://www.intel.com/content/dam/logos/intel-logo.png"   height="42" width="64" /> </span></footer></td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 42px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 0.75pt 10.5pt 33pt; height: 42px; width: 670.323px;">
<p style="line-height: 15.0pt;"></p>
</td>
